Z||000002||Adam Draper||04-03-2001||08:03 PM||||  well the three red colors are different <BR>because one of them is lighter the other is dark the last is darker or whatever way one of them is lighter and one darker. And alos the mixture of the paint there are two kinds of mixture one is the base in which you paint your car you only have to caot it a coulpe of times. Time limit is about 10-15 mins.Second mixture is clear coat and hardner<BR>this one you paint the car first than the clear coat goes on after the caots of paint.<BR>The drying time is a overnighter. The best one I think is clear coat.  best of luck.||||reg||6
